{"id":"c4309e85972199dc","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-marczewski-char.md","title":"Marczewski Characteristic Map","display":"thm-marczewski-char — Marczewski Characteristic Map","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-marczewski-char","aliases":["58-thm-marczewski-char","Marczewski characteristic map"],"display":"thm-marczewski-char — Marczewski Characteristic Map","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-marczewski-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-marczewski-char</span><span>Marczewski characteristic map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-marczewski-char — Marczewski Characteristic Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,I,A,h\\in V\">\\(X,I,A,h\\in V\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（函数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本原子定义的特征映射谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S(h,A,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,2^I)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(h(x)(i)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in A(i)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S(h,A,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,2^I)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(h(x)(i)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in A(i)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}char}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S(h,A,X,I)\\to\n\\Biggl(\n\\left[\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\,\n\\left(\nx\\neq y\\to\n\\exists i\\in I\\,\n\\bigl((x\\in A(i)\\land y\\notin A(i))\\lor(y\\in A(i)\\land x\\notin A(i))\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\,\n\\bigl(h(x)=h(y)\\to x=y\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\Biggr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}char}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S(h,A,X,I)\\to\n\\Biggl(\n\\left[\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\,\n\\left(\nx\\neq y\\to\n\\exists i\\in I\\,\n\\bigl((x\\in A(i)\\land y\\notin A(i))\\lor(y\\in A(i)\\land x\\notin A(i))\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\,\n\\bigl(h(x)=h(y)\\to x=y\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\Biggr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The left side says that the family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> separates points of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; the right side says that its characteristic map is injective.</li>\n<li>特征映射不再作为只在自然语言中出现的未约束符号：其定义域、陪域和每个坐标的取值均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S\\)</span> 固定。</li>\n<li>This established Marczewski-map theorem replaces the unsupported cardinal-characterizability formula previously stored in this atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$（函数谓词，见 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,I,A,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S(h,A,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,2^I)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(h(x)(i)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in A(i)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}marczewski\\text{-}char}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S(h,A,X,I)\\to\n\\Biggl(\n\\left[\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\,\n\\left(\nx\\neq y\\to\n\\exists i\\in I\\,\n\\bigl((x\\in A(i)\\land y\\notin A(i))\\lor(y\\in A(i)\\land x\\notin A(i))\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\,\n\\bigl(h(x)=h(y)\\to x=y\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\Biggr).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CharacteristicMap}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4294","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-marczewski-char.md|58-thm-marczewski-char]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}